\toprule
Analysis & Size \\
\midrule
IRL  & 100 trajectories, 1822 transitions \\
PRE--POST GAP  & 200 trajectories, 3194 steps \\
Probe evaluation  & 80/20 train/test \\
IRL evaluation & 20\% held-out validation \\
